{"v":1,"book":"Prov","ch":9,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Wisdom has built her house; She has hewn out her seven pillars;","tok":[{"t":"Wisdom","s":["H2454"]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"built","s":["H1129"],"a":[1]},{"t":" her "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; She has hewn "},{"t":"out","s":["H2672"],"a":[3]},{"t":" her "},{"t":"seven","s":["H7651"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"pillars","s":["H5982"],"a":[4]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":2,"text":"She has slaughtered her beasts; She has mingled her wine; She has also set her table;","tok":[{"t":"She has slaughtered her "},{"t":"beasts","s":["H2874"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; She has "},{"t":"mingled","s":["H4537"],"a":[2]},{"t":" her "},{"t":"wine","s":["H3196"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; She has also set her "},{"t":"table","s":["H7979"],"a":[6]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":3,"text":"She has sent forth her maidens; She calls from the highest places of the city:","tok":[{"t":"She has sent "},{"t":"forth","s":["H7971"],"a":[0]},{"t":" her "},{"t":"maidens","s":["H5291"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; She calls from the highest "},{"t":"places","s":["H4791"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"city","s":["H7176"],"a":[6]},{"t":":"}]},{"n":4,"text":"Whoever is simple, let him turn in here; As for him who lacks sense, she says to him,","tok":[{"t":"Whoever is "},{"t":"simple","s":["H6612"],"a":[1]},{"t":", let him turn "},{"t":"in","s":["H5493"],"a":[2]},{"t":" here; As for him who lacks sense, she "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[6]},{"t":" to him,"}]},{"n":5,"text":"Come, eat of my bread, And drink of the wine which I have mingled.","tok":[{"t":"Come","s":["H3212"]},{"t":", "},{"t":"eat","s":["H3898"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of my "},{"t":"bread","s":["H3899"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"drink","s":["H8354"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"wine","s":["H3196"],"a":[4]},{"t":" which I have "},{"t":"mingled","s":["H4537"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Forsake foolishness, and live, And walk in the way of understanding.","tok":[{"t":"Forsake","s":["H5800"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"foolishness","s":["H6612"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"live","s":["H2421"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"walk","s":["H0833"],"a":[3]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"understanding","s":["H0998"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"He who corrects a scorner gets dishonor for himself, And he who reproves a wicked man blemishes himself.","tok":[{"t":"He who corrects a "},{"t":"scorner","s":["H3887"],"a":[1]},{"t":" gets dishonor for himself, And he who "},{"t":"reproves","s":["H3256"],"a":[0]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[6]},{"t":" man blemishes himself."}]},{"n":8,"text":"Do not reprove a scorner, lest he hate you; Reprove a wise man, and he will love you.","tok":[{"t":"Do not "},{"t":"reprove","s":["H3198"],"a":[1]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"scorner","s":["H3887"],"a":[2]},{"t":", lest he "},{"t":"hate","s":["H8130"],"a":[4]},{"t":" you; Reprove a wise "},{"t":"man","s":["H2450"],"a":[6]},{"t":", and he will "},{"t":"love","s":["H0157"],"a":[7]},{"t":" you."}]},{"n":9,"text":"Impart something to a wise man, and he will become wiser still; Teach a righteous man, and he will increase in learning.","tok":[{"t":"Impart something to a "},{"t":"wise","s":["H2450"],"a":[1]},{"t":" man, and he will become "},{"t":"wiser","s":["H2449"],"a":[2]},{"t":" still; "},{"t":"Teach","s":["H3045"],"a":[4]},{"t":" a righteous man, and he will "},{"t":"increase","s":["H3254"],"a":[6]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"learning","s":["H3948"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"The fear of Jehovah is the beginning of wisdom, And the knowledge of the Holy One is understanding.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"fear","s":["H3374"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" is the "},{"t":"beginning","s":["H8462"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"wisdom","s":["H2451"],"a":[1]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"knowledge","s":["H1847"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"Holy","s":["H6918"],"a":[5]},{"t":" One is "},{"t":"understanding","s":["H0998"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"For by me your days will be multiplied, And the years of your life will be increased.","tok":[{"t":"For by me your "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[3]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"multiplied","s":["H7235"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"years","s":["H8141"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of your "},{"t":"life","s":["H2416"],"a":[7]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"increased","s":["H3254"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"If you are wise, you are wise for yourself; And if you are scornful, you alone will bear it.","tok":[{"t":"If you are "},{"t":"wise","s":["H2449"],"a":[1]},{"t":", you are "},{"t":"wise","s":["H2449"],"a":[2]},{"t":" for yourself; And if you are scornful, you alone will "},{"t":"bear","s":["H5375"],"a":[6]},{"t":" it."}]},{"n":13,"text":"The woman Foolishness is rowdy; She is simple and knows nothing.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"woman","s":["H0802"],"a":[0]},{"t":" Foolishness is rowdy; She is "},{"t":"simple","s":["H6615"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"and","s":["H1077"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"knows","s":["H3045"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"nothing","s":["H4100"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":14,"text":"And she sits at the door of her house, On a seat in the heights of the city,","tok":[{"t":"And she sits at the "},{"t":"door","s":["H6607"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of her "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[2]},{"t":", On a "},{"t":"seat","s":["H3678"],"a":[4]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"heights","s":["H4791"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"city","s":["H7176"],"a":[6]},{"t":","}]},{"n":15,"text":"To call to those who pass by, Who go straight on their ways:","tok":[{"t":"To "},{"t":"call","s":["H7121"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to those who pass by, Who go straight on their "},{"t":"ways","s":["H0734"],"a":[4]},{"t":":"}]},{"n":16,"text":"Whoever is simple, let him turn in here; And as for him who lacks sense, she says to him,","tok":[{"t":"Whoever is "},{"t":"simple","s":["H6612"],"a":[1]},{"t":", let him turn "},{"t":"in","s":["H5493"],"a":[2]},{"t":" here; And as for him who lacks sense, she "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[6]},{"t":" to him,"}]},{"n":17,"text":"Stolen waters are sweet, And bread gotten in secret is pleasant.","tok":[{"t":"Stolen","s":["H1589"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"waters","s":["H4325"],"a":[0]},{"t":" are "},{"t":"sweet","s":["H4985"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"bread","s":["H3899"],"a":[3]},{"t":" gotten in "},{"t":"secret","s":["H5643"],"a":[4]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"pleasant","s":["H5276"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":18,"text":"But he does not know that the dead are there, That her guests are in the depths of Sheol.","tok":[{"t":"But he does not "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[1]},{"t":" that the "},{"t":"dead","s":["H7496"],"a":[3]},{"t":" are there, That her "},{"t":"guests","s":["H7121"],"a":[7]},{"t":" are in the "},{"t":"depths","s":["H6012"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Sheol","s":["H7585"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]}]}
